Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.33,0:00:08.35,LusterCaptions,,0,0,0,,This is what your clients see when they\Nopen your booking page.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.00,0:00:13.35,LusterCaptions,,0,0,0,,They can explore your services and\Nchoose the appointment they want.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.86,0:00:20.08,LusterCaptions,,0,0,0,,Here, Sarah chooses BIAB Overlay and\Nadds optional Simple Nail Art.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.18,0:00:21.75,LusterCaptions,,0,0,0,,Then she taps Continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.17,0:00:27.21,LusterCaptions,,0,0,0,,Next, she chooses an available date and\Ntime.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.23,0:00:29.15,LusterCaptions,,0,0,0,,This studio has one technician.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.18,0:00:37.40,LusterCaptions,,0,0,0,,The review screen shows the service,\Nprice, duration, time, and location.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.90,0:00:41.45,LusterCaptions,,0,0,0,,She enters her name, email, and mobile\Nnumber.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.49,0:00:43.65,LusterCaptions,,0,0,0,,The required fields are clearly marked.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.15,0:00:47.42,LusterCaptions,,0,0,0,,She reads the appointment agreement
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.42,0:00:50.80,LusterCaptions,,0,0,0,,and checks the required acknowledgment\Nbefore continuing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.25,0:00:57.40,LusterCaptions,,0,0,0,,With the details reviewed, she taps\NConfirm appointment.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.33,0:01:02.94,LusterCaptions,,0,0,0,,The confirmation screen shows that the\Nbooking is complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.97,0:01:04.45,LusterCaptions,,0,0,0,,Her time is reserved.
